def scriptsDoiRecord_textDoc : String := "The text the receipt addresses, served as a resource so a client verifies it with verify { uuid, content }."
def scriptsDoiRecord_s2 : String := "the home page, the README, the npm README and the Zenodo record differ from the one text the build writes: run lake run index and commit the result"
def scriptsDoiRecord_summary : String := "One UUID is a register of ⟦0⟧ hexbits of ⟦1⟧ qubits, less ⟦2⟧ version and ⟦3⟧ variant qubits: ⟦4⟧ qubits in ⟦5⟧ bytes (Qpu.Verify.Uuid.free_is_122). Its high ⟦6⟧ qubits address ⟦7⟧ hexbit programs and its low ⟦8⟧ carry the message (Qpu.Verify.Uuid.program_capacity), so a machine holds one register for every ⟦5⟧ bytes of its memory at ⟦4⟧ qubits each, as the device receipt below counts. ⟦9⟧ declared theorems, ⟦10⟧ in the Lean 4 kernel, rest on ⟦11⟧ sorry, ⟦12⟧ are recomputed by a worked example (textbook_expressions_evaluate), each statement below is shown with its Lean proof and the line it stands on, and every tool is served over MCP at ⟦13⟧."
def scriptsDoiRecord_teleport : String := "For example, teleportation sends a message qubit across ⟦0⟧ qubits with ⟦1⟧ classical bits and ⟦2⟧ Pauli corrections: the density-matrix simulation of the algorithm door returns the message's X, Y and Z expectations at the receiver exactly, Lean decides the whole outcome table (QuantumCommunication.teleport_exact), and without the corrections the receiver's reduced state is maximally mixed, so nothing travels faster than light (QuantumCommunication.teleport_no_signalling)."
def scriptsDoiRecord_computer : String := "The computer these registers make is every circuit its quantum doors build: ⟦0⟧ worked examples across ⟦1⟧ doors, each replayed on this build and each named by the kernel theorem that makes it true (textbook_teleport_three_qubits is one), as the examples below list."
def scriptsDoiRecord_solved : String := "⟦0⟧ of the worked examples were made by the build itself, each from a statement no hand had worked, evaluated and replayed (textbook_expressions_evaluate); ⟦1⟧ declared theorems still have no example and stay open; and no language model takes part, so every figure here is computed by the build at no token cost."

end Prose
